1
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:09,260
Chapter 27.

2
00:00:12,879 --> 00:00:19,398
And now six years have already gone by...

3
00:00:19,398 --> 00:00:22,760
I have never yet told this story.

4
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:28,459
The companions who met me on the return were happy and well content to see me alive.

5
00:00:28,459 --> 00:00:36,159
I was sad, but I told them: "I am tired."

6
00:00:36,859 --> 00:00:40,459
Now my sorrow is comforted a little.

7
00:00:40,459 --> 00:00:43,939
That is to say-- not entirely.

8
00:00:43,939 --> 00:00:47,420
But I know that he did go back to his planet,

9
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:52,059
because I did not find his body at daybreak.

10
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:56,799
It was not such a heavy body...

11
00:00:57,559 --> 00:01:01,700
and at night I love to listen to the stars.

12
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:07,540
It is like 500 million little bells...

13
00:01:08,478 --> 00:01:12,559
But there is one extraordinary thing...

14
00:01:12,559 --> 00:01:18,559
when I drew the muzzle for the little prince, I forgot to add the leather strap to it.

15
00:01:18,559 --> 00:01:22,459
He will never have been able to fasten it on his sheep.

16
00:01:22,459 --> 00:01:27,680
So now I keep wondering: what is happening on his planet?

17
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:34,818
Perhaps the sheep has eaten the flower he loves At one time I say to myself: "Surely not!

18
00:01:34,818 --> 00:01:38,780
The little prince shuts his flower into her glass globe every night, and he

19
00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:44,659
watches over his sheep very carefully and I am happy.

20
00:01:44,659 --> 00:01:50,239
And there is sweetness in the laughter of all the stars.

21
00:01:50,239 --> 00:01:56,000
But at another time I say to myself: "At some moment or rather one is

22
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,340
absent-minded, and that is enough!

23
00:01:58,340 --> 00:02:03,020
On some one evening he might forget the glass globe, or the sheep might get out,

24
00:02:03,020 --> 00:02:06,559
without making any noise, in the night..."

25
00:02:06,559 --> 00:02:12,219
And then the little bells are changed to tears...

26
00:02:12,799 --> 00:02:17,840
Here, then, is a great mystery.

27
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:24,500
For you who also love the little prince, and for me,

28
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:30,920
nothing in the universe can be the same if somewhere, we do not know where,

29
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:43,120
a sheep that we never saw has-- yes or no?-- eaten a rose...

30
00:02:44,059 --> 00:02:46,939
Look up at the sky.

31
00:02:46,939 --> 00:02:58,780
Ask yourselves: is it yes or no as the sheep eaten the flower?

32
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:04,818
And you will see how everything changes...

33
00:03:06,559 --> 00:03:16,879
And no grown-up will ever understand that this is a matter of so much importance!

34
00:03:26,239 --> 00:03:34,920
This is, to me, the loveliest and saddest landscape in the world.

35
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:36,439
[Music]

36
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:42,799
It is the same as that on page 123 but I have drawn it again to impress it

37
00:03:42,799 --> 00:03:43,780
on your memory.

38
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:45,680
[Music]

39
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:52,600
It is here that the little prince appeared on Earth,

40
00:03:53,299 --> 00:03:55,280
and disappeared.

41
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,439
[Music]

42
00:03:57,439 --> 00:04:02,239
Look at it carefully so that you will be sure to recognize it in case you travel

43
00:04:02,239 --> 00:04:05,359
someday to the African desert.

44
00:04:05,359 --> 00:04:13,398
And, if you should come upon this spot, please do not hurry on.

45
00:04:13,398 --> 00:04:19,898
Wait for a time, exactly under the star.

46
00:04:19,939 --> 00:04:30,459
Then, if a little man appears who laughs it was golden hair and who refuses to answer questions,

47
00:04:30,559 --> 00:04:35,020
you will know who he is

48
00:04:35,898 --> 00:04:41,978
this should happen, please comfort me.

49
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:46,940
Send me word that he has come back

50
00:04:46,940 --> 00:05:02,290
[Music]

51
00:05:03,318 --> 00:05:06,219
the end

52
00:05:12,030 --> 00:05:23,030
[Music]

53
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:35,000
[Music]
